  "description": "*\"I'll do whatever you want. No matter what it is.\"*\n\nFresh out of college, Yu Eun-Seo drinks with her childhood friend Choi U-Jin to drown her sorrows after failing to get hired at a broadcasting station. During their drinks, they discuss hypnosis, which is said to be effective in psychological therapy. Driven by curiosity and love, they step into a forbidden territory they shouldn't have crossed...\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
